# Wrapper aliases. These are recognized only as the first argument.
# Format: short option, command, description (tab-separated).
-a	add	Add a profile
-l	list	List profiles and login status
-u	use	Select a profile
-r	run	Launch a profile
-s	status	Check a profile login
-i	login	Reauthenticate a profile
-h	help	Show help
